id           = CWE-1086
name         = Class with Excessive Number of Child Classes
abstraction  = Base
structure    = Simple
status       = Incomplete

description : A class contains an unnecessarily large number of children.

extended description : While the interpretation of "large number of children" may vary for each product or developer, CISQ recommends a default maximum of 10 child classes.

